    handle: "custom-awakening/02"
    type: "custom-awakening"
    excerpt: "The air hummed. The trees no longer whispered; they waited. Boof felt an understanding she had been walking toward since the furrow: the offering is the form you can use. You do not have to finish the paradox to eat f..."
