  s03: <
    handle: "custom-fool/03"
    type: "custom-fool"
    excerpt: "\"You’ve begun to see it, haven’t you, Boof?\" the Fool’s voice was softer now, almost kind. \"This journey isn’t about me at all. The seed is allowed to be late.\""
